      <div type="clause" n="17">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 17</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne geséce nan man ðonne cyng, buton he ne mote beon nanes rihtes wurðe innan his hundrede.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no-one shall appeal to the king, unless he fails to obtain justice within his hundred.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[And ne gesece nan man þone] cingc, butan he ne mote beon nanes rihtes wyrðe innan his hundrede.</ab>
      </div>
